; AUTO-GENERATED — aunt query over the in-repo genealogy (Wrap "Aunt" over the iterated set-algebra)
; Coincidence is checked PURELY BY MOVEMENT — the result trie is NEVER materialised here.
; A CURSOR (Root $prog) is moved by Descend: for every member the focus is a member
; (TermAt = T); for every boundary non-member it is not (TermAt = F); an absent key's focus
; is the empty subspace.  Ascend inverts Descend (the zipper contract), checked per file.
; For virtual cursors the Sub rules move LOCALLY through the operators — no operand is built.

(include "prelude.egg")
